# Version control and local editor state
**/.git
**/.github
**/.gitignore
**/.vs
**/.vscode
**/.idea
**/.classpath
**/.project
**/.settings
**/*.swp

# Secrets and local environment overrides (never baked into the image)
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example

# Dependencies and build artifacts are recreated inside the image
**/node_modules
**/npm-debug.log*
**/dist
**/build
**/coverage
**/*.tsbuildinfo

# Docker's own files and documentation
**/.dockerignore
**/docker-compose*
**/compose.y*ml
**/Dockerfile*
README.md
README.Docker.md
LICENSE

# OS clutter
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
